orage-manifest.json\ndocs/planning/evidence/P09/native-history/C07-Worf-failed-20261101-resume-04/storage-manifest.json\ndocs/planning/evidence/C44/native/cumulative/C07/storage-manifest.json\ndocs/planning/evidence/P09/native/cumulative/C07/storage-manifest.json\ndocs/planning/evidence/P09/native-history/C07-Worf-failed-02-20261101-resume-04/storage-manifest.json\ndocs/planning/evidence/P09/native-history/Worf-generation-03-complete-before-clippy-order-fix-20261101/native/cumulative/C07/storage-manifest.json\ndocs/planning/evidence/P09/native-history/Worf-generation-01-complete-20261101/native/cumulative/C07/storage-manifest.json\n","exit_code":2,"status":"failed"}}
