tyMissing),\n        };\n        // System proxy mode builds its client here, per admission.\n        let transport = state\n            .transport\n            .clone()\n            .ok_or(Refusal::CapabilityMissing)?\n72:    read_part: Option<crate::features::ProductId>,\n297:            read_part: None,\n303:                self.overview_started(&context);\n313:    pub(super) fn admit_read_part(\n327:            record.read_part = Some(product);\n330:        self.read_part_started(&context);\n379:            if let Some(product) = record.read_part {\n431:            self.overview_settled(&context, result);\n20:    \"C01-N01\": (X, [\"C44-N01\", \"C35-N01\"], \"the fixture app launches from the prepared bundle (every destination opened from the Go menu); the header names the destination\"),\n21:    \"C01-N02\": (X, [\"C44-N01\", \"C35-N01\"], \"the Go menu opens every destination; Settings from the status block's ⌘, button; View › Appearance switches the theme for every composite (c29.appearance)\"),\n22:    \"C01-N03\": (X, [\"C35-N03\", \"C36-N02\"], \"Tab reaches the Destinations rail with the focus ring; Enter on a card opens its product\"),\n23:    \"C01-N04\": (X, [\"C35-N02\"], \"the palette opens with its search row, typing narrows the rows, Enter navigates, Escape closes\"),\n26:    \"C01-N07\": (X, [\"C35-N01\", \"C36-N01\"], \"the rail's theme toggle and View › Appearance switch the shown appearance (light and dark captures)\"),\n27:    \"C01-N08\": (X, [\"C35-N01\", \"C35-N03\"], \"the Destinations navigation landmark with named destinations and ⌘ hints; headings per destination\"),\n28:    \"C01-N09\": (X, [\"C35-N03\"], \"900×600 with no horizontal overflow and the rail collapsed\"),\n29:    \"C01-N10\": (X, [\"C35-N03\"], \"200% zoom rows of the T09 matrix\"),\n43:    \"C02-N10\": (X, [\"C43-N03\", \"C35-N02\"], \"Tab reaches the tenant step's fields and the footer's primary; the tenant menu names Make active and Delete per tenant\"),\n166:    \"C08