il collapses\"),\n328:    \"C30-N01\": (X, [\"C38-N03\"], \"the guard through the switcher, the palette and the Go menu with a decision waiting; Escape and Stay keep the tenant and the decision; Archive and switch ends the conversation and lands the other tenant on Home with no engine (invariant I1)\"),\n329:    \"C30-N02\": (X, [\"C36-N01\", \"C37-N01\"], \"'First read pending' on Home and in the Inbox; Read now runs the read\"),\n330:    \"C30-N03\": (X, [\"C37-N01\"], \"snooze, acknowledge and unsnooze with the core's return time stated the same everywhere\"),\n331:    \"C30-N04\": (X, [\"C37-N02\"], \"Tab from Read now reaches the tabs and rows; Enter opens a row's detail\"),\n338:    \"C32-N01\": (X, [\"C38-N01\"], \"the title band names tenant, engine and workspace; a fresh tenant's first send starts a conversation\"),\n339:    \"C32-N02\": (X, [\"C38-N01\", \"C38-N02\", \"C38-N03\"], \"a decision held in the aside; Approve once / Decline; a tenant switch while it waits meets the guard\"),\n340:    \"C32-N03\": (X, [\"C38-N01\"], \"the mcpServers read waits, is approved in the page and made once\"),\n341:    \"C32-N04\": (X, [\"C38-N02\"], \"Tab from the message box; 900×600 at 200% without horizontal scroll\"),\n345:    \"C33-N03\": (X, [\"C35-N01\", \"C36-N01\", \"C40-N01\"], \"the Explain switch shows and hides the calls panel and the Explain banner\"),\n","exit_code":1,"status":"failed"}}
